# Cloudflare Pages redirects (copied verbatim into dist/ at build time).
# Format: <source> <destination> <status>
#
# Detail URLs are built from the entry's `type` (see src/utils/routes.ts), so
# moving an entry between sections changes its URL. Every such move gets one
# 301 per language here, otherwise the old URL (already indexed / shared) 404s.
# Sources carry the trailing slash — the site's canonical form; CF Pages
# 308-redirects slashless requests to it before this file is consulted.

# 2026-10-22 — ai-assisted-personal-website moved from /projects to /lab
/projects/ai-assisted-personal-website/    /lab/ai-assisted-personal-website/    301
/zh/projects/ai-assisted-personal-website/ /zh/lab/ai-assisted-personal-website/ 301
/nl/projects/ai-assisted-personal-website/ /nl/lab/ai-assisted-personal-website/ 301
